0:14.610">I'm </span><span begin="00:14.610" end="00:15.480">not </span><span begin="00:15.480" end="00:15.600">a </span><span begin="00:15.600" end="00:16.980">supermodel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.980" end="00:19.800"><span begin="00:16.980" end="00:17.370">I </span><span begin="00:17.370" end="00:18.330">still </span><span begin="00:18.330" end="00:18.690">eat </span><span begin="00:18.690" end="00:19.800">McDonalds</span><span begin="00:19.800" end="00:19.800">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.800" end="00:25.500"><span begin="00:19.800" end="00:21.120">Baby</span><span begin="00:21.120" end="00:21.810">, </span><span begin="00:21.810" end="00:22.260">that's </span><span begin="00:22.260" end="00:22.680">just </span><span begin="00:22.680" end="00:23.520">me</span><span begin="00:23.520" end="00:25.500">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.500" end="00:29.190"><span begin="00:25.500" end="00:25.860">Some </span><span begin="00:25.860" end="00:26.160">may </span><span begin="00:26.160" end="00:26.580">say </span><span begin="00:26.580" end="00:26.730">I </span><span begin="00:26.730" end="00:27.330">need </span><span begin="00:27.330" end="00:27.630">to </span><span begin="00:27.630" end="00:28.140">be </span><span begin="00:28.140" end="00:29.190">afraid</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.550" end="00:32.280"><span begin="00:29.550" end="00:29.790">of </span><span begin="00:29.790" end="00:30.420">losing </span><span begin="00:30.420" end="00:31.740">everything</span><span begin="00:31.740" end="00:32.280">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.280" end="00:33.870"><span begin="00:32.280" end="00:33.000">Because </span><span begin="00:33.000" end="00:33.210">of </span><span begin="00:33.210" end="00:33.660">where </span><span begin="00:33.660" end="00:33.870">I've</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.870" end="00:37.470"><span begin="00:33.870" end="00:34.440">If </span><span begin="00:34.440" end="00:34.620">i </span><span begin="00:34.620" end="00:35.250">started</span><span begin="00:35.250" end="00:35.250">,</span><span begin="00:35.250" end="00:35.760">Where </span><span begin="00:35.760" end="00:35.940">I </span><span begin="00:35.940" end="00:36.360">made </span><span begin="00:36.360" end="00:36.660">my </span><span begin="00:36.660" end="00:37.470">name</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.010" end="00:40.470"><span begin="00:38.010" end="00:38.370">But </span><span begin="00:38.370" end="00:39.330">everything's </span><span begin="00:39.330" end="00:39.450">the </span><span begin="00:39.450" end="00:40.470">same</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.530" end="00:48.030"><span begin="00:40.530" end="00:40.800">In </span><span begin="00:40.800" end="00:40.890">a </span><span begin="00:40.890" end="00:41.280">La</span><span begin="00:41.280" end="00:41.310">-</span><span begin="00:41.310" end="00:41.610">la </span><span begin="00:41.610" end="00:44.850">land </span><span begin="00:44.850" end="00:45.810">machine</span><span begin="00:45.810" end="00:46.260">. </span><span begin="00:46.260" end="00:47.580">Machine</span><span begin="00:47.580" end="00:48.030">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.030" end="00:50.850"><span begin="00:48.030" end="00:48.420">Who </span><span begin="00:48.420" end="00:49.410">said </span><span begin="00:49.410" end="00:49.740">I </span><span begin="00:49.740" end="00:50.130">can't </span><span begin="00:50.130" end="00:50.490">wear </span><span begin="00:50.490" end="00:50.850">my</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.850" end="00:53.370"><span begin="00:50.850" end="00:52.200">Converse </span><span begin="00:52.200" end="00:52.620">with </span><span begin="00:52.620" end="00:52.860">my </span><span begin="00:52.860" end="00:53.340">dress</span><span begin="00:53.340" end="00:53.370">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.370" end="00:59.070"><span begin="00:53.370" end="00:53.550">Oh</span><span begin="00:53.550" end="00:53.550">, </span><span begin="00:53.550" end="00:55.230">Baby</span><span begin="00:55.230" end="00:55.740">, </span><span begin="00:55.740" end="00:56.130">That's </span><span begin="00:56.130" end="00:56.550">just </span><span begin="00:56.550" end="00:57.120">me</span><span begin="00:57.120" end="00:59.070">!</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.070" end="01:02.130"><span begin="00:59.070" end="00:59.250">And </span><span begin="00:59.250" end="00:59.670">Who </span><span begin="00:59.670" end="01:00.600">said </span><span begin="01:00.600" end="01:00.810">I </span><span begin="01:00.810" end="01:01.110">can't </span><span begin="01:01.110" end="01:01.320">be </span><span begin="01:01.320" end="01:02.130">single</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.130" end="01:04.860"><span begin="01:02.130" end="01:02.220">i </span><span begin="01:02.220" end="01:02.580">have </span><span begin="01:02.580" end="01:04.170">to </span><span begin="01:04.170" end="01:04.860">mingle</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.860" end="01:08.910"><span begin="01:04.860" end="01:06.990">BABYYY</span><span begin="01:06.990" end="01:06.990">, </span><span begin="01:06.990" end="01:07.470">That's </span><span begin="01:07.470" end="01:07.740">not </span><span begin="01:07.740" end="01:08.910">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.060" end="01:10.620"><span begin="01:09.060" end="01:09.810">Noo</span><span begin="01:09.810" end="01:09.810">, </span><span begin="01:09.810" end="01:10.350">noo</span><span begin="01:10.350" end="01:10.620">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.620" end="01:14.520"><span begin="01:10.620" end="01:11.070">Some </span><span begin="01:11.070" end="01:11.310">may </span><span begin="01:11.310" end="01:11.760">say </span><span begin="01:11.760" end="01:11.970">I </span><span begin="01:11.970" end="01:12.480">need </span><span begin="01:12.480" end="01:12.780">to </span><span begin="01:12.780" end="01:13.260">be </span><span begin="01:13.260" end="01: